### Percobaan 1 - Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "cindy@gmail.com",
    "password": "cindy123"
}

### Percobaan 2 - Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "cindy@gmail.com",
    "password": "cindy123"
}

### Percobaan 3 - GET Students Tanpa Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Percobaan 4 - POST Students Tanpa Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nim": "230009999",
    "name": "Budi",
    "major": "Informatika",
    "gpa": 3.5,
    "birthdate": "2004-05-12"
}

### Percobaan 5 - POST Students Dengan Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nim": "230009999",
    "name": "Budi",
    "major": "Informatika",
    "gpa": 3.5,
    "birthdate": "2004-05-12"
}

### Percobaan 6 - Token Dimodifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/saya
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x

### Percobaan 7 - Token Expired
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/saya
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Percobaan 8 - Payload Token Diubah
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/saya
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPalsu}}